/-!
This module houses the correctness proofs for the
  ______ _                  _       _      _____      _
 |  ____(_)                (_)     | |    / ____|    | |
 | |__   ___  ___ __   ___  _ _ __ | |_  | (___   ___| |_
 |  __| | \ \/ / '_ \ / _ \| | '_ \| __|  \___ \ / _ \ __|
